{
  "case": "16-composed-vs-decomposed",
  "contract": "LogicalUsageV1",
  "algorithm_version": 1,
  "description": "The same visible text in two Unicode spellings, one document each.",
  "covers": [
    "PRINCIPLES.md#internationalization-is-structural"
  ],
  "input": {
    "account": "acct-1",
    "workspaces": [
      {
        "workspace": "ws-1",
        "state": "ENABLED",
        "counted": true,
        "documents": [
          {
            "document": "doc-1",
            "listing": {
              "kind": "page",
              "trashed_at": null
            },
            "durable": true,
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "n1",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 0,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Précis — Grüße — Água",
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 29
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "document": "doc-2",
            "listing": {
              "kind": "page",
              "trashed_at": null
            },
            "durable": true,
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "n1",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 0,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Précis — Grüße — Água",
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 32
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "blobs": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "derivation": [
    "workspace ws-1 (ENABLED):",
    "    doc-1/n1 (paragraph): node.text 21 = 21",
    "  document doc-1: 21",
    "    doc-2/n1 (paragraph): node.text 24 = 24",
    "  document doc-2: 24",
    "  -> documents_units 45 + files_bytes 0 = 45",
    "account: documents_units 45 + files_bytes 0 = 45"
  ],
  "expected": {
    "workspaces": [
      {
        "workspace": "ws-1",
        "workspace_state": "ENABLED",
        "counted": true,
        "usage_state": "OK",
        "documents_units": 45,
        "files_bytes": 0,
        "logical_usage_units": 45,
        "algorithm_version": 1
      }
    ],
    "account": {
      "usage_state": "OK",
      "documents_units": 45,
      "files_bytes": 0,
      "logical_usage_units": 45,
      "algorithm_version": 1
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "21 scalars against 24 for text that looks identical. Deliberate, not a defect: content is never NFC-normalised (PRINCIPLES.md), so the two spellings are two different strings and the store carries each byte-exactly.",
    "A grapheme-cluster count would make them equal and is refused: grapheme segmentation depends on a Unicode table that changes between library versions, and a bill must not move when a dependency is upgraded.",
    "UTF-8 bytes would not have escaped this either (29 against 32).",
    "Now the pure form of the case: with structure free, these two documents are nothing but their characters.",
    "Strings are koru_store_core::fixtures COMPOSED and DECOMPOSED."
  ]
}
